    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-reasons-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Explain reasons and consequences",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "因为 introduces a reason and 所以 introduces its result. With a clear causal connection, one connector can naturally be omitted. Retaining or omitting a connector does not turn unrelated events into a cause and result.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "因为下雨，所以我没去。",
                "pinyin": "yīnwèi xiàyǔ ， suǒyǐ wǒ méi qù 。",
                "meaning": "Because it was raining, I did not go.",
                "audio": "2164d8e3a4127b44722b2c1cf7ca083e5b51619dba9a906a0535829847d9f93f"
              },
              {
                "text": "因为下雨，我没去。",
                "pinyin": "yīnwèi xiàyǔ ， wǒ méi qù 。",
                "meaning": "Because it was raining, I did not go.",
                "audio": "9d2a6b16a56ede63e013d330801c08694122c01b1c7b8e00b609ecb72819daeb"
              },
              {
                "text": "下雨了，所以我没去。",
                "pinyin": "xiàyǔ le ， suǒyǐ wǒ méi qù 。",
                "meaning": "It started raining, so I did not go.",
